 "readings": [
  "R-line: a derive row's `line` is its element's line, here its attribute's (every derive list in the fixture is on one line); a call row's the leaf's (as the shipped `Registration.line`); an impl or fn row's the item's.",
  "R-form: `form` is NULL on derive, impl and fn rows; `path` on an `add_message` type and an `add_plugins` path leaf; `factory` on a call leaf; `closure` on a closure.",
  "R-ord: rows of a file in source order: by line; on one line in written order, a `pipe` argument right after its leaf.",
  "R-symbol-ord: only derive, fn and closure rows carry `symbol_ord`; a row with a subject (impl, call) is NULL there.",
  "R-certainty: every row with a subject is `certain` (code and macro tokens alike); `uncertain` comes from `cfg_attr` and unreadable calls only.",
  "R-group: `group_text` is NULL on every row but `system`; a `pipe` argument carries its leaf's group.",
  "R-macro: a macro-token subject is the name only (here bare names, so either reading gives these rows)."
 ],
 "open": [
  "Every value here is derived by hand (Phase A); Phase B confirms it against the first run and records any deviation as a reading, never by copying the output in."
 ]
